{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Sneakers are a ",["l","鞋类","footwear"]," item in Stardew Valley. They can be purchased from and sold at the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"]," after completing the ",["l","任务","\"Initiation\""]," quest. They can also be found as a ",["l","矿井","special item"]," in floors 1-39 of ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]," by killing ",["l","矿井","special monsters"]," or by breaking ",["l","矿井","crates and barrels"],", or in ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chests"]," after reaching ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing level 2"],"."]]]]]}